        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If you want to try again, please provide the userdata for flickr."
      ],
      "justification": "These elements model the retry decision point and the subsequent data-entry step. Also covers the functionally identical redundant phrasing in i6."
    },
    {
